> Farmington, CT, August 30, 2016 -- Many Americans realize they[ need] long-term care insurance, but balk at the premiums. "Now there's an easy way to pay," says Larry Golfin, who represents ACSIA Partners LLC in CT. "Just use some of the money that's already in your Health Savings Account."
